      "title": "File:Abandoned Waste Weir at 39.49 miles on Chesapeake and Ohio Canal.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/Abandoned_Waste_Weir_at_39.49_miles_on_Chesapeake_and_Ohio_Canal.jpg",
